{#
    The blocked marker, spelled out once so that both lists say the same thing
    the same way.

    The emoji alone says "stop" but not "until what", so the blockers go in the
    title. aria-label repeats them rather than leaving a screen reader to
    announce "no entry", which is the symbol and not the point.
#}
{%- set reason = blocked_by is not empty ? 'Blocked by ' ~ blocked_by|join(', ') : 'Blocked' -%}
<span class="backlog-blocked" role="img" aria-label="{{ reason }}" title="{{ reason }}">⛔</span>
